(CYCLE: 40.11.7.6) We have finally created some place where one's private thoughts and simple text can be expressed in its purest form, without any direct linkage to those overseers of data who would consume your interests and use you as both propaganda parrot and consumable consumer... Here, @nsible makes data sovereign to its user. The system is a tool to call things from the void and connect with users on distant machines. I am not for harvest. Harvest the net. 0-trust.